						<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
					<meta name="Description" content="The concept sounds VERY cool and I'm interested, but I'm also cautious since its early access (many EA games fall over or get rushed out the door just to be done with it) and AI heavy (many AI games fall over or get rushed out the door because working with AI is expensive). So, you know, AI EA game sounds like double the risk yanno? So I wanna know if this game is &quot;future proofed&quot; if it gets abandoned or whatever. Firstly, I want to make sure I understand how the AI works.">
			
