					Nov 1 @ 7:02pm				</div>

			</div>
							<a class="forum_comment_action forum_comment_action_trigger" data-tooltip-type="selector" data-tooltip-content="#forum_comment_actions_menu_562546398187387886">
					<span><i class="ico16 arrow_down"></i></span>
